{
  "pages": [
    {
      "slug": "kaffeegetraenke",
      "menu": "Kaffee: Getränke im Vergleich",
      "title": "Espresso, Americano, Flat White & Co. – die Unterschiede",
      "excerpt": "Was ist der Unterschied zwischen Espresso, Americano, Flat White, Cappuccino und Latte Macchiato? Mit Zeichnungen, Mengen und Geschmack im Überblick.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "x": "Fast jedes Kaffeegetränk besteht aus nur drei Dingen: Espresso, heißem Wasser und Milch. Entscheidend ist das Mengenverhältnis und wie die Milch aufgeschäumt wird. Hier sehen Sie, was in welche Tasse kommt."
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "x": "<style>\n.kg-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(270px,1fr));gap:18px;margin:6px 0 0}\n.kg-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6ddd2;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.kg-card svg{width:100%;height:210px;display:block}\n.kg-body{padding:14px 16px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}\n.kg-tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a4b1f}\n.kg-card h3{margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25}\n.kg-card p{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55}\n.kg-layers{list-style:none;margin:2px 0;padding:0;font-size:13.5px}\n.kg-layers li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:2px 0;margin:0}\n.kg-layers i{width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #0003;flex:none}\n.kg-facts{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.kg-facts span{background:#f3ece1;border-radius:99px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:12.5px}\n.kg-say{font-size:13px;color:#6b5d52;border-top:1px dashed #e6ddd2;padding-top:8px}\n.kg-vs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px}\n.kg-vs div{background:#faf7f2;border:1px solid #e6ddd2;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55}\n.kg-vs h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px}\n.kg-tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}\n.kg-tbl th,.kg-tbl td{padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e6ddd2;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}\n.kg-tbl th{background:#f3ece1}\n.kg-tblw{overflow-x:auto}\n</style><div class=\"kg-grid\"><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ristretto: Espresso, Crema\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u0bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u00\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u01\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#d9a56a\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u0bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"182\" rx=\"81\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"175\" rx=\"70.2\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#d9d1c4\" opacity=\".55\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"172\" rx=\"70.2\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\"/><clipPath id=\"u0c\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"68\" rx=\"2\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u0c)\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"132\" width=\"90\" height=\"34.8\" fill=\"url(#u00)\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"121.12\" width=\"90\" height=\"11.680000000000001\" fill=\"url(#u01)\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"121.12\" rx=\"45\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#d9a56a\" opacity=\".85\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"68\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M193 112.96000000000001 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M193 112.96000000000001 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8e0d4\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"><path d=\"M132 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M154.5 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M177 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/></g></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Der Kürzeste</div><h3>Ristretto</h3><p>Der Espresso wird früh abgebrochen. Weniger Wasser läuft durch das Kaffeemehl, daher schmeckt er besonders konzentriert, süßlich und kaum bitter.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b97a3f,#d9a56a)\"></i>Crema</li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ca. 15 ml</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>15–20 ml</span><span>Intensiv · süßlich</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Kleine Tasse, ein Schluck, danach lange nachschmeckend.</div></div></div><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Espresso: Espresso, Crema\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u1bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u10\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u11\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#d9a56a\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u1bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"182\" rx=\"81\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"175\" rx=\"70.2\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#d9d1c4\" opacity=\".55\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"172\" rx=\"70.2\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\"/><clipPath id=\"u1c\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"68\" rx=\"2\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u1c)\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"123.84\" width=\"90\" height=\"42.959999999999994\" fill=\"url(#u10)\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"112.96000000000001\" width=\"90\" height=\"11.680000000000001\" fill=\"url(#u11)\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"112.96000000000001\" rx=\"45\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#d9a56a\" opacity=\".85\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"68\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M193 112.96000000000001 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M193 112.96000000000001 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8e0d4\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"><path d=\"M132 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M154.5 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M177 92 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/></g></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Die Basis</div><h3>Espresso</h3><p>Die Grundlage fast aller Getränke. Heißes Wasser wird mit Druck durch fein gemahlenen Kaffee gepresst. Oben liegt die goldbraune Crema.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b97a3f,#d9a56a)\"></i>Crema <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Crema</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ca. 30 ml</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>25–40 ml</span><span>Kräftig · aromatisch</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Die Crema ist ein Zeichen für frisch gemahlene Bohnen.</div></div></div><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Americano: Heißes Wasser, Espresso, Crema\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u2bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u20\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#cfe0e6\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#e6f0f3\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#cfe0e6\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u21\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u22\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#d9a56a\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#b97a3f\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u2bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"108\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"173\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#d9d1c4\" opacity=\".55\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"170\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\"/><clipPath id=\"u2c\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u2c)\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"105.75999999999999\" width=\"120\" height=\"59.04\" fill=\"url(#u20)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"76.63999999999999\" width=\"120\" height=\"29.92\" fill=\"url(#u21)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"68.79999999999998\" width=\"120\" height=\"8.64\" fill=\"url(#u22)\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"68.79999999999998\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#d9a56a\" opacity=\".85\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8e0d4\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"><path d=\"M126 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M156 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M186 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/></g></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Espresso + Wasser</div><h3>Americano</h3><p>Ein Espresso, der mit heißem Wasser verlängert wird. Ohne Milch, mild und lang, ähnlich wie Filterkaffee, aber mit dem Aroma des Espressos.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b97a3f,#d9a56a)\"></i>Crema</li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– 1 Espresso</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#cfe0e6,#e6f0f3)\"></i>Heißes Wasser <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ca. 120–150 ml</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>150–200 ml</span><span>Mild · klar</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Wer „einen großen schwarzen Kaffee“ möchte.</div></div></div><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Flat White: Espresso, Warme Milch, Milchschaum\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u3bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u30\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u31\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fbf4e8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u32\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fff8ea\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u3bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"108\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"173\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#d9d1c4\" opacity=\".55\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"170\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\"/><clipPath id=\"u3c\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u3c)\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"128.16\" width=\"120\" height=\"36.64\" fill=\"url(#u30)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"72.16\" width=\"120\" height=\"56.8\" fill=\"url(#u31)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"63.199999999999996\" width=\"120\" height=\"9.760000000000002\" fill=\"url(#u32)\"/></g><path d=\"M150 66.2 c-16 -12 -8 -24 0 -16 c8 -8 16 4 0 16z\" fill=\"#4a2c17\" opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8e0d4\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"><path d=\"M126 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M156 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M186 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/></g></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Kräftig und samtig</div><h3>Flat White</h3><p>Ein doppelter Espresso mit besonders fein aufgeschäumter Milch. Die Milch ist „flach“, also fast ohne Schaumkrone. Kaffee und Milch verbinden sich zu einem samtigen Geschmack.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffdf7,#fff8ea)\"></i>Milchschaum <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Hauch Mikroschaum</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1e6d3,#fbf4e8)\"></i>Warme Milch <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Feine Milch</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Doppelter Espresso</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>150–180 ml</span><span>Kräftig · samtig</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Mehr Kaffeegeschmack als im Cappuccino.</div></div></div><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cappuccino: Espresso, Warme Milch, Milchschaum\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u4bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u40\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u41\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fbf4e8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u42\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fff8ea\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u4bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"108\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"173\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#d9d1c4\" opacity=\".55\"/><ellipse cx=\"158\" cy=\"170\" rx=\"93.60000000000001\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\"/><clipPath id=\"u4c\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u4c)\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"132.64\" width=\"120\" height=\"32.160000000000004\" fill=\"url(#u40)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"103.51999999999998\" width=\"120\" height=\"29.92\" fill=\"url(#u41)\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"65.43999999999997\" width=\"120\" height=\"38.88\" fill=\"url(#u42)\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"65.43999999999998\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#fffdf7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"112\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M208 76.64 h16 q18 0 18 20 q0 20 -18 20 h-18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8e0d4\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"><path d=\"M126 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M156 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/><path d=\"M186 46 c-8 -10 8 -16 0 -28\"/></g></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Drittel-Regel</div><h3>Cappuccino</h3><p>Je ein Drittel Espresso, heiße Milch und Milchschaum. Die dicke, luftige Schaumhaube macht ihn leicht und cremig.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffdf7,#fff8ea)\"></i>Milchschaum <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ⅓ Milchschaum</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1e6d3,#fbf4e8)\"></i>Warme Milch <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ⅓ Milch</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– ⅓ Espresso</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>150–180 ml</span><span>Ausgewogen · luftig</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Klassiker für den Vormittag.</div></div></div><div class=\"kg-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Latte Macchiato: Warme Milch, Espresso, Milchschaum\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"u5bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#efe3d1\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#dcc7ab\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u50\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fbf4e8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#f1e6d3\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u51\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#5a3318\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#2e1608\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"u52\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#fff8ea\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"300\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#u5bg)\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"182\" rx=\"81\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#0002\"/><clipPath id=\"u5c\"><path d=\"M105 26 v128 q0 14 14 14 h62 q14 0 14 -14 v-128z\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#u5c)\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"96\" width=\"90\" height=\"70.8\" fill=\"url(#u50)\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"14.8\" fill=\"url(#u51)\"/><rect x=\"105\" y=\"40\" width=\"90\" height=\"42.8\" fill=\"url(#u52)\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"40.000000000000014\" rx=\"45\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#fffdf7\"/><path d=\"M105 26 v128 q0 14 14 14 h62 q14 0 14 -14 v-128\" fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\".18\" stroke=\"#9fb3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M114 34 v114\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".6\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"169\" rx=\"45\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#9fb3b8\" opacity=\".5\"/></svg><div class=\"kg-body\"><div class=\"kg-tag\">Geschichtet im Glas</div><h3>Latte Macchiato</h3><p>Heiße Milch im Glas, der Espresso wird vorsichtig dazugegossen und setzt sich zwischen Milch und Schaum ab. So entstehen drei sichtbare Schichten.</p><ul class=\"kg-layers\"><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffdf7,#fff8ea)\"></i>Milchschaum <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Milchschaum</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e1608,#5a3318)\"></i>Espresso <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Espresso</span></li><li><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1e6d3,#fbf4e8)\"></i>Warme Milch <span style=\"color:#6b5d52\">– Heiße Milch</span></li></ul><div class=\"kg-facts\"><span>250–300 ml</span><span>Mild · cremig</span></div><div class=\"kg-say\">Wird mit Löffel oder Strohhalm getrunken.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "t": "h",
          "lvl": 2,
          "x": "Americano und Flat White – oft verwechselt?"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "x": "<div class=\"kg-vs\"><div><h3>Americano</h3>Ein Espresso, der mit heißem Wasser aufgefüllt wird. Es ist <b>keine Milch</b> im Spiel. Das Ergebnis erinnert an Filterkaffee, schmeckt aber nach Espresso. Tipp: erst das Wasser, dann den Espresso einlaufen lassen, so bleibt die Crema erhalten.</div><div><h3>Flat White</h3>Hier steht die <b>Milch</b> im Mittelpunkt: ein kräftiger doppelter Espresso und Milch, die so fein aufgeschäumt ist, dass sie fast flüssig wirkt. Im Unterschied zum Cappuccino gibt es nur eine dünne Schaumschicht. Der Kaffeegeschmack bleibt vorn.</div></div>"
        },
        {
          "t": "h",
          "lvl": 2,
          "x": "Alle Getränke im Überblick"
        },
